de there re-prompts about hourly).\n\n**Older names.** Gateway configurations written before this key use `inferenceGatewayOidc` / `inferenceGatewayOidcAuthFlow` with the `interactive` kind; they stay readable and mean the same sign-in.',{docsUrl:`${Oe.COWORK_3P_DOCS_BASE}/configuration#inferenceidpoidc`})}})};var iM=W.z.object({kind:W.z.literal("external-idp"),...lM.idpSignInShape}),ew=lM.idpSignInShape;lM.IDP_OIDC_FLAT_KEY=(qv=R.fieldMetaForNode(ew.oidc))===null||qv===void 0?void 0:qv.flatKey;lM.IDP_AUTH_FLOW_FLAT_KEY=(Gv=R.fieldMetaForNode(ew.authFlow))===null||Gv===void 0?void 0:Gv.flatKey;var oM=(e,t)=>lM.IDP_OIDC_FLAT_KEY!==void 0&&t.inferenceProvider==="gateway"&&va(e)&&(!va(t.inferenceCredentialKind)||t.inferenceCredentialKind==="interactive"||t.inferenceCredentialKind==="external-idp");lM.GATEWAY_IDP_OIDC_KEY={path:"inferenceGatewayOidc",use:`${lM.IDP_OIDC_FLAT_KEY} with inferenceCredentialKind: "external-idp" once every desktop in the fleet is on a release that reads them`,effect:"the original spelling will keep working; no end date has been set",editorPreserves:!0,match:oM};lM.GATEWAY_IDP_AUTH_FLOW_KEY={path:"inferenceGatewayOidcAuthFlow",use:`${lM.IDP_AUTH_FLOW_FLAT_KEY} together with ${lM.IDP_OIDC_FLAT_KEY} once every desktop in the fleet is on a release that reads them`,effect:"the original spelling will keep working; no end date has been set",editorPreserves:!0,match:(e,t)=>oM(e,t)&&(va(t.inferenceGatewayOidc)||lM.IDP_OIDC_FLAT_KEY!==void 0&&va(t[lM.IDP_OIDC_FLAT_KEY]))};lM.GATEWAY_INTERACTIVE_WITH_IDP={path:'inferenceCredentialKind: "interactive" together with inferenceGatewayOidc (gateway)',use:'"external-idp" once every desktop in the fleet is on a release that reads it',effect:'the original spelling will keep working ("interactive" with inferenceGatewayOidc is read as "external-idp"); no end date has been set',editorPreserves:!0,match:(e,t)=>lM.IDP_OIDC_FLAT_KEY!==void 0&&t.inferenceProvider==="gateway"&&e==="interactive"&&(va(t.inferenceGatewayOi