var GRn=` Once the mod has loaded and the person has seen it do what they asked, offer once, in one line, to publish the mod to the organization's library; until then, sharing goes unmentioned unless the person raises it. Wait for their answer; a GitHub repository is for when the person asks for one. Say "the mod", not "it". Where the person says no, that answer stands for the rest of this session.`;var zRn=`

